From 29dd45d2f9d6cd629d27222706374be7b5784c97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: unjordi <jordi@ciencias.unam.mx>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:03:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Idle-skip for declared wait loops

A game config lists wait-loop head blocks under [idle]; the translator emits idle_poll there and the runtime fast-forwards turns that cannot reach the next scheduler event. Ikaruga declares kmWaitVBlank's loop (katana_wait_vblank). --no-idle-skip turns it off; the report counts skips.
